    {
      "subId": "7110602",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711060201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711060201": {
            "id": "711060201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We're back, Uncle Luo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060202"
            ]
          },
          "711060202": {
            "id": "711060202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Ohh, thank you! The tea cauldron technician has already arrived and is tinkering with it over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060203"
            ]
          },
          "711060203": {
            "id": "711060203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Speaking of which, has the tea problem been solved?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060204"
            ]
          },
          "711060204": {
            "id": "711060204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "It has indeed! If only the tea cauldron could be fixed too, we might be able to turn this place into a tourist hotspot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060205"
            ]
          },
          "711060205": {
            "id": "711060205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "You know, this tea cauldron is said to be a divine treasure that was given to Qiaoying Village by that Cloud Retainer from Jueyun Karst... *sigh* I wonder what's gone wrong with it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060206"
            ]
          },
          "711060206": {
            "id": "711060206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err... So what's she doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060207"
            ]
          },
          "711060207": {
            "id": "711060207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Eh, I don't understand the technician's jargon either. Structural analysis this, bond graph that... Anyway, she's examining the tea cauldron.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060208"
            ]
          },
          "711060208": {
            "id": "711060208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, over there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060209"
            ]
          },
          "711060209": {
            "id": "711060209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060213",
              "711060212"
            ]
          },
          "711060213": {
            "id": "711060213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Before long, Hautemontagne finishes the examination...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060214"
            ]
          },
          "711060214": {
            "id": "711060214",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Mr. Luo! I've finished examining the tea cauldron. From the look of it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060215"
            ]
          },
          "711060215": {
            "id": "711060215",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Eh? You two are back!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060216"
            ]
          },
          "711060216": {
            "id": "711060216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I was worried about the tea cauldron.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060217"
            ]
          },
          "711060217": {
            "id": "711060217",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Haha, no need to worry. There's no such thing as a problem that can't be solved, after all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060218"
            ]
          },
          "711060218": {
            "id": "711060218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "So, how's it looking? What's wrong with the tea cauldron?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060219"
            ]
          },
          "711060219": {
            "id": "711060219",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "It's not so much the tea cauldron itself, as... Well, take a look at the bond graph I've sketched out over here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060220"
            ]
          },
          "711060220": {
            "id": "711060220",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "The flow source itself should be fine, but something's off with the performance of several gyrators over here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060221"
            ]
          },
          "711060221": {
            "id": "711060221",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Flow... What now? Paimon's totally perplexed!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060222"
            ]
          },
          "711060222": {
            "id": "711060222",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Ahaha... Apologies! I'm just so used to using all these technical terms...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060223"
            ]
          },
          "711060223": {
            "id": "711060223",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "In layman's terms, the tea cauldron itself is probably fine, but there's something wrong with three of the connected mechanisms. This is causing the flow of elemental energy nearby to act a little funny.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060224"
            ]
          },
          "711060224": {
            "id": "711060224",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Three mechanisms... Oh, right! You say \"mechanisms,\" we say \"monoliths\"! Mountain Ley Lines wind all over the place, so you have to control them with sacred stones to prevent chaotic elemental energy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060225"
            ]
          },
          "711060225": {
            "id": "711060225",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Hmm... Chaotic elemental energy is indeed a terrifying thing, but these mechanisms... shouldn't have much to do with the Ley Lines. They aren't directly connected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060226"
            ]
          },
          "711060226": {
            "id": "711060226",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "While we can't clearly see how the mechanisms are structured, their operating principles are the same! Those legendary adepti must have been phenomenal artisans!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060227"
            ]
          },
          "711060227": {
            "id": "711060227",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Hehe, you're not wrong there! I may not understand the mechanical mysteries at work here... But that Cloud Retainer sure is an incredible adeptus for having come up with such ingenuity!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060228"
            ]
          },
          "711060228": {
            "id": "711060228",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "These \"monoliths\"... Functionally speaking, a more accurate name would be \"Three-Phase Asynchronous Elemental Tuners.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060229"
            ]
          },
          "711060229": {
            "id": "711060229",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? Tuners?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060230"
            ]
          },
          "711060230": {
            "id": "711060230",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "That's right! According to the records, the great master Alain Guillotin himself — founder of the Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering — also designed a constrained layer dampener to regulate the elemental energy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060231"
            ]
          },
          "711060231": {
            "id": "711060231",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "While his blueprints are long lost, the principle should be the same... Emphasis on \"should\" be!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060232"
            ]
          },
          "711060232": {
            "id": "711060232",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Haha... Shame I'm too old to learn such things. So, let me ask again, what caused this problem? Is it serious, and can it be fixed?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060233"
            ]
          },
          "711060233": {
            "id": "711060233",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Us technicians don't get too concerned with whether a problem is serious or not! We only think about whether or not it can be fixed. As for this particular issue... Let's just say if it wasn't fixable, I'd have left a long time ago!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060234"
            ]
          },
          "711060234": {
            "id": "711060234",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Haha, well that's a relief! There I was, thinking the adepti saw us as a bunch of neglectful fools, and had cast some kind of magic on this ward to make it irreparable!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060235"
            ]
          },
          "711060235": {
            "id": "711060235",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Mr. Luo, all devices are fundamentally the same! If they're left for too long without being maintained or repaired, it's only natural that problems will arise!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060236"
            ]
          },
          "711060236": {
            "id": "711060236",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "As Master Guillotin once said — no matter what the system, or how ingenious the original design, all mechanisms will eventually collapse if left to run completely on their own!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060237"
            ]
          },
          "711060237": {
            "id": "711060237",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, that went right over Paimon's head... But anyway, if we can just fix those \"tuners,\" that should solve the problem, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060238"
            ]
          },
          "711060238": {
            "id": "711060238",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Yep, that's right! The three mechanisms connected to the tea cauldron aren't too far from here, so if you let me go take a look, I should be able to fix them!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060239"
            ]
          },
          "711060239": {
            "id": "711060239",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We'll come help too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060240"
            ]
          },
          "711060240": {
            "id": "711060240",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Thanks, that's very kind of you! In that case, there's no point waiting around — let's get going!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060241"
            ]
          },
          "711060241": {
            "id": "711060241",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "#Haha... Excellent! {M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}, Paimon, I'll leave this tea cauldron business to your good selves and the technician!"
          },
          "711060212": {
            "id": "711060212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Err, pretty sure that's not what that is..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7110606",
      "subQuestName": "Return to Qiaoying Village and look for Uncle Luo",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711060801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711060801": {
            "id": "711060801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uncle Luo! With Mountain's help, all three mechanisms have now been taken care of!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060802"
            ]
          },
          "711060802": {
            "id": "711060802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Uncle Luo",
            "text": "Haha, I knew you three could do it! Such extraordinary skill!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060803"
            ]
          },
          "711060803": {
            "id": "711060803",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "#It was all thanks to {NICKNAME} and Paimon! I just need to do some final checks now, though there shouldn't be any problems... You two wouldn't be able to help out again, would you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060804"
            ]
          },
          "711060804": {
            "id": "711060804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, let's head up together!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060805"
            ]
          },
          "711060805": {
            "id": "711060805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You follow Hautemontagne to the tea cauldron...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060806"
            ]
          },
          "711060806": {
            "id": "711060806",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "After tapping the tea cauldron lightly, a slight look of surprise appears on Hautemontagne's face...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060807"
            ]
          },
          "711060807": {
            "id": "711060807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, what's up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060808"
            ]
          },
          "711060808": {
            "id": "711060808",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Hmm, there's just something strange about the echo. According to my calculations, it should be more of a \"thump—thump—thump\" sound...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060809"
            ]
          },
          "711060809": {
            "id": "711060809",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Could you have miscalculated, maybe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060810"
            ]
          },
          "711060810": {
            "id": "711060810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Surely that's way too abstract, anyway! What do you mean by \"thump—thump—thump\"!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060811"
            ]
          },
          "711060811": {
            "id": "711060811",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Hautemontagne",
            "text": "Well... The tea cauldron's empty, so going by the formula left by Master Guillotin, the echo should be much clearer! What in Teyvat could be the reason...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060812"
            ]
          },
          "711060812": {
            "id": "711060812",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What exactly is the problem? Can't see anything from the outside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060814",
              "711060820"
            ]
          },
          "711060814": {
            "id": "711060814",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060815"
            ]
          },
          "711060815": {
            "id": "711060815",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "*taps the tea cauldron* Like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060816"
            ]
          },
          "711060816": {
            "id": "711060816",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... No response?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060817"
            ]
          },
          "711060817": {
            "id": "711060817",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "*taps the tea cauldron* Or like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060818"
            ]
          },
          "711060818": {
            "id": "711060818",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still no respo... Wahhhh!"
          },
          "711060820": {
            "id": "711060820",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon can't fit in there! No way, surely!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060821"
            ]
          },
          "711060821": {
            "id": "711060821",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon feels like we've discussed this before, but... Why do you always try to get Paimon to go into such strange places!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060822"
            ]
          },
          "711060822": {
            "id": "711060822",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Forget it! I'll check it out myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060823"
            ]
          },
          "711060823": {
            "id": "711060823",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060824"
            ]
          },
          "711060824": {
            "id": "711060824",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "*taps the tea cauldron* Like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060825"
            ]
          },
          "711060825": {
            "id": "711060825",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... No response?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711060826"
            ]
          },
          "711060826": {
